cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this reproduction, please cite both this repository and the
  original ViperGPT paper.
title: "Reproduction of ViperGPT: Visual Inference via Python Execution for Reasoning"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sankarshan
    email: sankarshan703@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/vipergpt-repro"
abstract: >-
  A thesis-grade, reproducible reimplementation of ViperGPT that replaces the
  deprecated Codex program generator with an open-weights code model, and
  reproduces the RefCOCO/RefCOCO+, GQA, OK-VQA, and NExT-QA results
  (Tables 1-4 of the original paper).
license: MIT
